{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
There's [Bb]a list upon the table and a [Dm7]weight upon my chest
A [Ebmaj7]thousand things I'm carrying that [D#m7]never let me rest
But [Bb]I hear the word again
Do not be [Dm7]anxious about anything
In [Ebmaj7]everything, by prayer and peti[D#m7]tion, with thanksgiving
[Cm7]Present your requests to [F7sus4]God
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
